OL,3,GNEWSA'Icon of the ice age' shows what
OL,4,Acan be found in caves
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe skull of a woolly rhino dating back
OL,7,Fabout 50,000 years has been put on
OL,8,Fdisplay a few miles from where it was
OL,9,Ffound.
OL,11,FAlong with other parts of the skeleton,
OL,12,Fit was discovered in 2025 at Fairy Cave
OL,13,FQuarry on the Mendip Hills in Somerset.
OL,14,FCave archaeologist Vince Simmonds said
OL,15,Fthe find had helped show the public
OL,16,Fwhat discoveries can emerge from cave
OL,17,Fsites.
OL,19,FIt has been put on display at the
OL,20,Fnearby Wells and Mendip Museum, where
OL,21,Fleaders have described the find as
OL,22,F"rare" and "very unusual".
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
