OL,3,GNEWSA'Icon of the ice age' shows what
OL,4,Acan be found in caves
OL,5,
OL,6,FProfessor Danielle Schreve, a
OL,7,Fpalaeoecologist from Bristol, has been
OL,8,Fstudying the item, which she described
OL,9,Fas an "icon of the Ice Age", adding
OL,10,Fthat it can offer an "insight into how
OL,11,Flandscapes change".
